ity has failed in practice:** Pellham withdrew its C$2.4B equity offering because investor demand fell short. It is now cutting 2027 transformer orders by about 40% and deferring two substation programmes until financing improves (pellham-offering).\n- **Equity is weak across the sector:** two other utility share offerings were cut back in size (utility-credit, Q3 2026).\n- **Debt is still available:** bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 to 165bp. Even so, Norvane priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably (utility-credit).\n\n**Implication:** Utilities will probably have to lean on debt, or scale back and defer projects, as Pellham has done. Pellham is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria, so its cuts could also hit grid-equipment demand.\n\n**Limits of this answer:** The sources don't give Norvane's equity needs or the utilities' balance-sheet headroom. They also don't say how much more debt the utilities can take on before credit ratings are affected.","ttft_ms":1464,"type":"result","duration_ms":18442,"uuid":"b5af6e16-8206-47c8-87d6-9fa5b8032c01","ttft_stream_ms":1262,"time_to_request_ms":114,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":9,"system_prompt":4,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":3,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":10,"init_frame_send":10,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":6,"request_announcements":15,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":8,"tool_schema_build":3,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":7,"request_build":12},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":63,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":75,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":205,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":132,"process_rss_mib_result":204,"process_anon_mib_result":123,"process_peak_rss_mib":223,"process_cpu_ms_turn":644,"process_wall_ms_turn":18442,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":51,"process_wall_ms_